      "name": "Garth",
      "created_at": "2021-08-19T15:28:26.819Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am running version 13 latest developer.</p>\n<p>When my users access Support - Issues and then go into any issue to view the details a message pops up saying “No permission for Support Settings”</p>\n<p>I can’t find anything online but I suspect it has something to do with the roles or module permissions as Administrator doesn’t have the message pop up.</p>\n<p>Does anyone know what could be causing this?</p>",
