    {
      "id": 304596,
      "username": "alasserr",
      "name": "Adrien Lasserre",
      "created_at": "2021-11-10T10:46:08.322Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi Garth, I’ve had the same problem when adding a specific new role to manage some tickets, I just added the following permissions and now it is fine :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Support settings =&gt; Read | Export</li>\n<li>Issue priority =&gt; Read | Export<br>\n(and I have previously copie/modified the ones that already set in the <em>Support Team</em> role)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Nota : my ERPNext is in French, the names of the Permissions/Roles can be slightly different in english, I supposed their translation but have not properly checked.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/f9ae1b/{size}.png",
