      "created_at": "2025-11-04T18:19:16.912Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"alasserr\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"79267\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/f9ae1b/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> alasserr:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>Support settings =&gt; Read | Export</li>\n<li>Issue priority =&gt; Read | Export</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hi can you show some screen short please.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ol>\n<li>you mean <strong>Roles &amp; Permissions</strong> under user screen ?</li>\n<li>or Support &gt; <strong>Support Settings</strong> ?</li>\n<li>or <strong>Role Profile ?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thank you</p>",
